# Right steps the scene manager forward: colour cycle -> parallax -> coast
# road -> waterfall -> credits, then wraps back to the colour cycle, which
# re-runs cycleColorsInit.
# The colour cycle only redraws on 64-frame boundaries of frame_count,
# which runs about 7 frames behind the emulator's count (interrupts are
# masked during boot), so its steps land at emulator frames 71, 135, 199,
# 263, 327, 391, 455...
run 150
shot before-switch         d5f97892 # blue: two steps in
press right
run 40
shot parallax-entered      964d718e # parallax city
press right
run 40
shot coast-entered         65991885 # coast road (init blanks ~21 frames)
press right
run 80
shot waterfall-entered     0fd93b6e # waterfall (init blanks ~58 frames)
press right
run 40
shot credits-entered       7469cc3b # credits: banner and hex dump, first line arriving
press right
run 40
shot back-to-colours       aa58f654 # green: reset at the switch, stepped at 391
hold start
run 64
shot start-held            aa58f654 # green: Start resets before the 455 step
